IS A ANTIBODY (Anti HAV) \u2013 IGM<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ELISA<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=72 valign=top style='width:54.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:10.5pt'>0.06<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=72 valign=top style='width:54.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:10.5pt'>COV<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=240 valign=top style='width:180.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Negative &lt;= 0.90 <\/span><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Equivocal\u00a0 - 0.91<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt'>0.91-1.10\r\n  Positive &gt;1.11<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=342 valign=top style='width:256.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=72 valign=top style='width:54.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=72 valign=top style='width:54.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=240 valign=top style='width:180.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'><\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=342 valign=top style='width:256.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=72 valign=top style='width:54.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=72 valign=top style='width:54.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=240 valign=top style='width:180.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'><\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=342 valign=top style='width:256.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=72 valign=top style='width:54.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=72 valign=top style='width:54.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=240 valign=top style='width:180.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'><\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>COMMENT<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Hepatitis A Virus\r\nis a RNA virus of Picornavirus family transmitted by fecal- oral route.\r\nInfection with HAV is self limiting though 5-10% cases may show a secondary\r\nrise in liver enzymes. Since symptomatic Hepatitis A virus infections are\r\nclinically indistinguishable from Hepatitis B or C virus, serological testing\r\nis an extremely important tool to <\/span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>achieve proper diagnosis. During\r\nthe acute phase of HAV infection, IgM appears in patient\u2019s serum in nearly all\r\ncases at the onset of symptoms, peaks within the first month<\/span><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> of\r\nillness and persists for 3- 6 months. It declines to undetectable levels within\r\n1 year. The most effective diagnostic determination of HAV acute infection is\r\nthe detection of<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Anti HAV- IgM.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Note:<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>1. Patients\r\nexhibiting Borderline Reactivity should be monitored at weekly intervals.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>2. Reactive\r\nresults suggest recent HAV infection<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>3. RA factor can\r\ngive rise to false positive results<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>4.\r\nFalse negative \/ positive results are observed in patients receiving mouse\r\nmonoclonal antibodies for diagnosis or therapy.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\